      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WOOPI BLUEBIRDS (1) flew the lids and led throughout to score last time at big odds, winning by 2.25 lengths at this track over 320m (18.25). Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. TRUE PROMISES (2) has mixed form recently, finishing fourth (18.66) in a Grade 5 at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Well placed here and can atone this time. HELLO NEMO (5) is a progressive type who recorded his 5th career win last time out (22.99) at this track. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Expecting another bold showing. ANJO PRINCE (7) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
